8. Rahsia kekayaan = masa (kompaun, log, titik silang) (slot: Monday 30 Nov 2026)
   Status:   SCHEDULED Wed 25 Nov 2026 10:02 (moved up from Mon 30 Nov), 2:39. YouTube Short (EDUCATION) + IG Reel only, NO TikTok (finance).
             Metricool id 441152888 / uuid 555385583631155723. Labur Santai featured on site.
   FINANCE TOPIC -> YouTube + Instagram only, NO TikTok. Book: Labur Santai (https://s.shopee.com.my/3g5L2Y11vv).
   Maths (annual compounding, r = 6%; KWSP 2025 dividend 6.15%):
     A = P(1+r)^t ; ln A = ln P + t ln(1+r) (straight line on log scale); doubling t = ln2/ln(1+r) ~ 72/r.
     "Titik silang" (user called it inflection point; an exponential has no true inflection): year when yearly
     dividend > yearly saving. With saving C/yr from zero: r*B = C  ->  (1+r)^t = 2  ->  t* = doubling time, B* = C/r.
     RM500/month: year 12 balance RM101,220, dividend RM6,073 > RM6,000.
     Target RM1m at 60 from age 25: t* = 12 y (age 37), +3 buffer -> save RM1,116/month to age 40 (RM311,805,
     put in RM200,940), then stop adding and leave 20 y -> RM1,000,000. Saving all 35 y would need RM748/month (RM314k in).
   Added 25 Nov: CTA asks viewers to comment age now / target / target age (user replies with their titik silang
             saving) + calculator page kafelembaran.com/kira (pages/kira.html, same maths, tested in test_build.py).
   Visual plan: chessboard rice doubling; curve vs log-line chart; balance bars with dividend crossing saving at year 12.
